The '''Memorial Shrine''' was a monument dedicated to all who had [[Death|died]] during the [[Great Clan Wars|Mandalorian Civil War]]. Located on the top floor of [[Peace Park]] in the [[planet]] [[Mandalore]]'s [[capital]] [[city]] of [[Sundari]], the structure was dominated by a split spire.<ref name="Fact File" /> In the [[Standard year|year]] [[21 BBY]],<ref name="Galactic Atlas" /> the Memorial Shrine was shattered in a [[Attack on the Memorial Shrine|bombing]] engineered by the [[Death Watch]].<ref name="The Mandalore Plot" /> Though [[Duchess]] [[Satine Kryze]] ordered the statue left in its broken state as a warning against pointless violence, the monument was removed entirely during the [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Occupation of Mandalore|occupation]] of Mandalore.<ref name="Fact File" />

